<title>UK: World Bank sets 500 million mark five-year bond.</title>
<headline>World Bank sets 500 million mark five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Deutsche Morgan Grenfell, UBS and Westdeutsche Landesbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   COUPON     4.625     MATURITY    18.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.79    PAY DATE    18.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    99.415    SPREAD	+16 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.375     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
